	"data": "Matter of Time\n\nA VR experience series — part futurology speech, part interactive narrative, part consciousness experiment. The user sits in cithoreal's actual bedroom while he presents his vision of the near future, then invites them to explore it.\n\nWhat It Is\n\nMatter of Time is cithoreal's flagship VR experience — a multi-episode series where he invites the user into his own room (photogrammetrically scanned) and presents a guided futurology report mixed with interactive storytelling. It's…",
